    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>ISC Gallery Marquee delivers a smooth, hardware-accelerated infinite horizontal scrolling gallery designed explicitly to expand Elementor layout capabilities. Create custom image rows with distinct speeds, directions, and typography elements.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>isc-gallery-marquee</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Open any Page or Post within Elementor and search for the &#8216;ISC Gallery Marquee&#8217; widget.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial baseline production release.</li>\n<li>Added native Elementor widget integration class structure.</li>\n<li>Implemented built-in Freemius licensing core sdk layer.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "An infinite scrolling image gallery marquee widget designed cleanly for Elementor layouts.",
    "description": "<p>ISC Gallery Marquee delivers a smooth, hardware-accelerated infinite horizontal scrolling gallery designed explicitly to expand Elementor layout capabilities. Create custom image rows with distinct speeds, directions, and typography elements.</p>\n",
